 Cayman issued a total of 8,945,307 Class B ordinary shares and on April 21, 2023, Youxin Cayman issued a total of 55,762 Class A ordinary shares (of which 13,296 Class A ordinary shares were issued to former Mezzanine Equity Holders). The issuance of shares effected before the final step of reorganization. Guangzhou Youxin’s shareholders obtained the shares issued by Youxin Cayman and agreed to transfer their equity interests to WFOE, see Note 1.","context":"Ordinary Shares","section":"","block":411,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-040322","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-27","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001964946","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1964946/000149315226040322/ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/a9b2824247bc11170fe64c981b9d5ade10a214e309549425781f1e45c802bbe4.bin","sha256":"a9b2824247bc11170fe64c981b9d5ade10a214e309549425781f1e45c802bbe4"}},{"id":"b762c5cc35412171c8ca4891d59ecb05a98688b357ba5aa31c0cad811afb0927","quote":"On September 8, 2025, the Company closed another public offering (the “September 2025 Public Offering”) of 53,571 units (the “Units”) at a public offering price of $112.00 per Unit, with each Unit consisting of: (i) one Class A Ordinary Share (the “Class A Shares”); (ii) one Series A Warrant to purchase one Class A Share (the “Series A Warrants”); (iii) one Series B Warrant to purchase such number of Class A Shares as determined in the Series B Warrant (the “Series B Warrants” and together with the Series A Warrants, the “Warrants”).","context":"September 2025 Public Offering","section":"","block":418,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-040322","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-08-27","reportDate":"2026-03-31","cik":"0001964946","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1964946/000149315226040322/ex99-1.h